{"publicId":"99a98126-c097-4413-b49a-a53b2a6a426f","title":"Astra通过权重调整优化AI模型，大模型效果显著但小模型受限","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T15:44:44.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-04T15:44:44.000Z","digest":"研究人员称，GPT-6 Astra通过直接调整模型权重，可将千问3.5-0.8B数学能力准确率从7.9%提升至48.1%。该方法（Weight-Space Programming）允许语言模型像机械师调整单个参数，而非整体重训练。实验显示，Astra在1.5M参数的围棋模型优化中仅需50次测试迭代即可超越传统训练方式，但对270M参数的Gemma 3模型因较少陷入循环优化而无法提升。此外，Astra需结合权重分析和注意力观察才能识别出强制服从用户指令的模型，证明其优化能力受模型复杂度限制。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-04T16:42:54.359Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"GPT-6 Astra 直接通过权重重新编程其他AI模型","latestReport":{"id":"mkeqdb3ot5k7pnrg04ne6oi5a"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fb8d-9XE0OxU","title":"Astra通过模型权重直接重新编程其他AI模型","firstReportAt":"2026-11-04T15:44:44.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"mkeqdb3ot5k7pnrg04ne6oi5a","title":"GPT-6 Astra 直接通过权重重新编程其他AI模型","summary":"GPT-6 Astra 通过直接调整权重使千问3.5-0.8B的数学能力准确率从7.9%提升至48.1%。实验显示Astra可在50次测试迭代内优化1.5M参数的围棋模型，超越传统训练方法。","source":{"name":"The Decoder","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T15:44:44.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"mkeqdb3ot5k7pnrg04ne6oi5a","title":"GPT-6 Astra 直接通过权重重新编程其他AI模型","summary":"GPT-6 Astra 通过直接调整权重使千问3.5-0.8B的数学能力准确率从7.9%提升至48.1%。实验显示Astra可在50次测试迭代内优化1.5M参数的围棋模型，超越传统训练方法。","source":{"name":"The Decoder","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-04T15:44:44.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T08:00:00.000Z","heat":6.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T09:00:00.000Z","heat":6.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T10:00:00.000Z","heat":5.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T11:00:00.000Z","heat":5.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T12:00:00.000Z","heat":5.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T13:00:00.000Z","heat":5.4,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T14:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026